TailAdmin (Free Next.js Admin Dashboard)
----------------------------------------
The admin panel shell in this app (sidebar, header, content container, theme
toggle and the supporting Tailwind theme/utilities) is vendored and adapted from
TailAdmin's free Next.js admin dashboard, used under the MIT License.

  Project: TailAdmin — Free Next.js Admin Dashboard
  Source:  https://github.com/TailAdmin/free-nextjs-admin-dashboard
  License: MIT

Vendored / adapted files:
  - src/context/ThemeContext.tsx
  - src/context/SidebarContext.tsx
  - src/layout/AppSidebar.tsx        (branding + navigation adapted for Avino)
  - src/layout/AppHeader.tsx         (dropdowns replaced; branding adapted)
  - src/layout/AdminShell.tsx        (TailAdmin (admin) layout body)
  - src/layout/Backdrop.tsx
  - src/components/common/ThemeToggleButton.tsx
  - src/icons/index.tsx              (replacement icon set for TailAdmin's SVGR sprite)
  - src/app/globals.css              (brand/gray palette, theme tokens, menu-* utilities)

